      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that talking about support feels impossible when your sense of self feels so fractured. What you are describing—a fundamental loss of self following a trauma—is profound and incredibly difficult to carry. Please remember that while the \"old you\" may feel lost, the capacity for a new sense of being exists, even if it feels buried now. Reaching out, even just to acknowledge the depth of this emptiness to a professional, is a first step toward finding a way to integrate this new experience.",
      "source": "target",
